  "abstract": "Covers the Agent Network Protocol (ANP) 1.2 specifications for agent identity, authentication, description, discovery and negotiation: did:wba DIDs with e1_ Ed25519 key-fingerprint paths, eddsa-jcs-2022 DID Document proofs and successorDid key rotation (ANP-03), RFC 9421 and RFC 9530 DID request authentication with DIDWba challenges and Authentication-Info tokens (ANP-02), the plain-JSON Agent Description document (ANP-07), /.well-known/agent-descriptions discovery (ANP-08), and the draft anp.negotiate meta-protocol (ANP-06). It lists two version lines: ANP 1.2 (current, posture track, with 1.1 folded in) and ANP 1.0 (legacy, upgraded from). SKILL.md holds the invariants and workflow; references split out versions, did:wba with authentication, and description, discovery and negotiation.",
